                    </orgName>
                  <note>The LEMDO Team is based at the University of Victoria and normally comprises the project director, the lead developer, project manager, junior developers(s), remediators, encoders, and remediating editors.</note>  
                </org>
                <org xml:id="LEMD2"><orgName><reg>LEMDO Group (2020-2023)</reg></orgName><note>The LEMDO Group comprises the Lead Applicant and the Co-Applicants on the three-year 2020-2023 SSHRC Partnership Development grant.</note>
